o Beef Extract, Desiccated 44\nL45@P2: Difco Beef Extract 44\nL46@P2: Gelysate Peptone 46\nL47@P2: Bacto Neopeptone 47\nL48@P2: Bacto Peptone 48\nL49@P2: Polypeptone Peptone 49\nL50@P2: Bacto Proteose Peptone 50\nL51@P2: BiTek Proteose Peptone 50\nL52@P2: Bacto Proteose Peptone No. 2 50\nL53@P2: Bacto Proteose Peptone No. 3 50\nL54@P2: BiTek Proteose Peptone No. 3 50\nL55@P2: Bacto Proteose Peptone No. 4 50\nL56@P2: Bacto Tryptose 54\nL57@P2: Acidicase Peptone 56\nL58@P2: Bacto Casamino Acids 56\nL59@P2: Bacto Casamino Acids, Technical 56\nL60@P2: Difco Casamino Acids, Vitamin Assay 56\nL61@P2: Biosate Peptone 58\nL62@P2: Difco Casein Digest 59\nL63@P2: Bacto Casitone 60\nL64@P2: Difco Tryptone 60\nL65@P2: Bacto Tryptone 60\nL66@P2: BiTek Tryptone 60\nL67@P2: Bacto TC Lactalbumin Hydrolysate 63\nL68@P2: Typical analyses\nL69@P2: Meat peptones 64\nL70@P2: Casein and whey peptones 66\nL71@P2: Starter Paks 68\nL72@P2: Gibco product information\nL73@P2: Starter Pak No. 1 68\nL74@P2: Starter Pak No. 2 68\nL75@P2: Starter Pak No. 3 69\nL76@P2: Chemically defined supplements\nL77@P2: and feeds 70\nL78@P2: Introduction 70\nL79@P2: Gibco product information\nL80@P2: Recharge Supplement without Glucose\nL81@P2: and L-Glutamine 71\nL82@P2: Resurge Chemically Defined Supplements\nL83@P2: CD1–5 without Glucose and L-Glutamine 72\nL84@P2: OneFeed Supplement 74\nL85@P2: Microbial and vaccine media 75\nL86@P2: Introduction 75\nL87@P2: Gibco product information\nL88@P2: Bacto Tryptose Phosphate Broth 76\nL89@P2: Difco PPLO Broth 78\nL90@P2: Difco Malt Extract Broth 79\nL91@P2: Bacto Brain Heart Infusion 80\nL92@P2: Difco Brain Heart Infusion,\nL93@P2: without Dextrose 80\nL94@P2: Bacto Brain Heart Infusion, Porcine 80\nL95@P2: Protocols and definition of methods 82\nL96@P2: Supplement titration and blending protocols 82\nL97@P2: Peptone procedure 82\nL98@P2: CD supplement procedure 85\nL99@P2: OneFeed Supplement usage instructions 87\nL100@P2: Adaptation of cells 89\nL101@P2: Definition of methods 90\nL102@P2: Regulatory documentation 91\nL103@P2: Certificates of Analysis 91\nL104@P2: Change Notification Program 91\nL105@P2: Certificates of Suitability 91\nL106@P2-3: Product listings 92 Introduction\nL107@P3: The Gibco™ technical guide to peptones, supplements, and feeds was\nL108@P3: developed as an easy-to-use reference tool to provide technical information\nL109@P3: and guidance in the selection of performance enhancing products for use\nL110@P3: in cell culture and microbial fermentation production, from research and\nL111@P3: development to the final finished product. It is our commitment to innovation\nL112@P3: and product consistency that makes Gibco™ BioProduction Services a\nL113@P3: leading supplier and strong global partner. We offer a full line of supplements,\nL114@P3: feeds, and cell culture media for the biotechnology, biopharmaceutical, and\nL115@P3: animal and human vaccine markets.\nL116@P3-4: 45\nL117@P4: Our dedication to mammalian and microbial media\nL118@P4: applications is exemplified in our wide range\nL119@P4: of capabilities:\nL120@P4: • Bioproduction media and supplements\nL121@P4: manufacturing—As part of Gibco BioProduction\nL122@P4: Services, we are focused on the development and\nL123@P4: manufacture of peptones and supplements. Our\nL124@P4: full suite of manufacturing services are tailored to\nL125@P4: meet the needs of your production process—from\nL126@P4: rapid small-scale medium production to full-scale\nL127@P4: GMP medium manufacturing. Our comprehensive\nL128@P4: manufacturing capabilities offer flexibility and capacity\nL129@P4: without sacrificing quality. Focused on meeting your\nL130@P4: needs, we are able to customize products, processes,\nL131@P4: and testing to meet your requirements, all while\nL132@P4: adhering to stringent quality standards.\nL133@P4: • Full line of supplements and feeds for the\nL134@P4: biopharmaceutical market—Gibco BioProduction\nL135@P4: Services is a pioneer and a trusted partner of leading\nL136@P4: biopharmaceutical companies around the world. As\nL137@P4: a result, our peptones and supplements are used in\nL138@P4: the manufacture of more than 150 animal and human\nL139@P4: health biopharmaceuticals on the market today.\nL140@P4: Our offering of animal origin–free, animal origin, and\nL141@P4: chemically defined supplements and feeds are tailored\nL142@P4: to work in a variety of biopharmaceutical applications\nL143@P4: to help you achieve optimal production yields with\nL144@P4: consistent performance.\nL145@P4: • Media design service—We offer a full of range of\nL146@P4: services from the development of custom media and\nL147@P4: feed formulations to the optimization of existing media\nL148@P4: and feeds. Our experience, combined with our proven\nL149@P4: methodology and extensive analytical capabilities,\nL150@P4: allows us to provide customers with media options that\nL151@P4: work with their unique specifications, with time and\nL152@P4: budget in mind.\nL153@P4: History\nL154@P4: Beginning in 1895, Difco Laboratories produced\nL155@P4: high-quality enzymes, dehydrated tissues, and glandular\nL156@P4: products to aid in the digestion process. Meat and\nL157@P4: other protein digests were developed to stimulate the\nL158@P4: growth of bacteria and fungi. Extensive research led to\nL159@P4: the development of Difco™ Bacto™ Peptone, which was\nL160@P4: introduced in 1914. Building on this knowledge base,\nL161@P4: we have continued to develop and expand our peptone\nL162@P4: offerings under these premium brands to support the\nL163@P4: wide range of requirements and applications for the\nL164@P4: bioproduction market.\nL165@P4: In 1997, Becton, Dickinson and Company (BD)\nL166@P4: acquired Difco Laboratories and, in 2006, created the\nL167@P4: Advanced Bioprocessing product line that focused on\nL168@P4: high-quality solutions to meet the growing needs of the\nL169@P4: biopharmaceutical market.\nL170@P4: Today, Thermo Fisher Scientific offers the Advanced\nL171@P4: Bioprocessing products after acquiring them from BD in\nL172@P4: 2018. This integration combines the historic, trusted Difco\nL173@P4: and Gibco premier brands and provides comprehensive\nL174@P4: supplements and media solutions in one portfolio,\nL175@P4: delivering even greater value to our customers.\nL176@P4: Service\nL177@P4: The Gibco BioProduction Services network maintains\nL178@P4: inventory throughout the world. With multiple\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBacto™ Casamino Acids 500 g | Buy Online | Gibco™ | thermofisher.com (https://www.thermofisher.com/order/catalog/product/223050)\nciteturn15view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 days ago; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.thermofisher.com/order/catalog/product/223050\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 205\nL0: You need to enable JavaScript to run this app.\nL1: \nL2: Hamburger Menu Button\nL3: \nL4: 【0†Sign in】\nL5: \nL6: Don't have an account ? 【1†Create Account】\nL7:   * Products\nL8:     * 【2†Antibodies】\nL9:     * 【3†Cell Culture Media】\nL10:     * 【4†Chemicals】\nL11:     * 【5†Chromatography Columns and Cartridges】\nL12:     * 【6†Lab Equipment】\nL13:     * 【7†Lab Plasticware and Supplies】\nL14:     * 【8†Microplates】\nL15:     * 【9†Oligos, Primers, Probes and Genes】\nL16:     * 【10†TaqMan Real-Time PCR Assays】\nL17:     * 【11†Greener Products】\nL18:     * 【12†See all product categories】\nL19:   * Applications\nL20:     * 【13†Bioprocessing】\nL21:     * 【14†Cell Culture and Transfection】\nL22:     * 【15†Cell and Gene Therapy】\nL23:     * 【16†Chromatography】\nL24:     * 【17†Molecular Testing】\nL25:     * 【18†Digital Solutions】\nL26:     * 【19†DNA and RNA Extraction and Analysis】\nL27:     * 【20†Spectroscopy, Elemental and Isotope Analysis】\nL28:     * 【21†See all applications and techniques】\nL29:   * Services\nL30:     * 【22†360° CDMO and CRO Solutions】\nL31:     * 【23†CDMO Services】\nL3