   * 【50†Quick Order】\nL64:   * 【51†Order Status and Tracking】\nL65:   * 【52†Documents and Certificates】\nL66: \nL67: Search\nL68: \nL69: Search All\nL70: \nL71: [Input] [Input]\nL72: \nL73: Search\nL74: \nL75: [Input: Search by catalog number, product name, keyword, application] [Input]\nL76: \nL77: [Input]\nL78: \nL79: [Input]\nL80: \nL81:   * 【51†Order Status】\nL82:   * 【50†Quick Order】\nL83:   * 【48†Promos】\nL84:   * Sign in\nL85: \nL86: 【0†Sign in】\nL87: \nL88: Don't have an account ? 【1†Create Account】\nL89:     *     *     * 【53†Account】\nL90:     * 【51†Check Order Status】\nL91:     * 【54†Connect: Lab, Data, Apps†apps.thermofisher.com】\nL92:     * 【0†Custom Products & Projects】\nL93:     * 【55†Services Central†apps.thermofisher.com】\nL94: \nL95:   * 【56†Image: Bacto&trade; Soytone】\nL96: \nL97: Gibco™\nL98: # Bacto™ Soytone\nL99: \nL100: Bacto Soytone is an enzymatic digest of soy that uses an animal origin (AO) (porcine) enzyme for digestion. The naturally Read more\nL101: \nL102: Change view\nL103: \nL104: Catalog Number  | Quantity\nL105: --- | ---\nL106: 243620  | 500 g\nL107: 243610  | 10 kg\nL108: \nL109: 2 Options\nL110: \nL111: Catalog number 243620\nL112: \nL113: Price (CHF)\nL114: \nL115: 166.00\nL116: \nL117: Each\nL118: \nL119: Add to cart\nL120: \nL121: Quantity:\nL122: \nL123: 500 g\nL124: \nL125: Price (CHF)\nL126: \nL127: 166.00\nL128: \nL129: Each\nL130: \nL131: Add to cart\nL132: Bacto Soytone is an enzymatic digest of soy that uses an animal origin (AO) (porcine) enzyme for digestion. The naturally high concentrations of vitamins and carbohydrates found in soy make Bacto Soytone a nutritious and excellent carbohydrate source for those not concerned about the processing step involving an animal-based material.\nL133: This supplement offers a unique nutritional profile as compared to other soy products, and so can be a valuable alternative to consider for supplementing both mammalian and microbial processes.\nL134: Specifications\nL135: \nL13